        "clause_html": "<div class=\"clause-line\">Explore the <span class=\"g-tok\">Elements Codex</span> &amp; <span class=\"eq-tok\">G-Index</span></div><div class=\"clause-line\" style=\"font-size:30px;color:#cbd5e1;\">• Subscribe to <strong>@geometor</strong> for all 465 propositions</div><div class=\"clause-line\" style=\"font-size:30px;color:#cbd5e1;\">• Share questions &amp; insights in the comments</div><div class=\"clause-line\" style=\"font-size:30px;color:#cbd5e1;\">• Star &amp; contribute at <strong>github.com/geometor</strong></div>",
